  "name": "Retirement and Participation Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The House of Lords Retirement and Participation Committee was appointed by the House on 18 December 2025. It will consider and report to the House on:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The impact of a retirement age on the House, particularly its size and functioning &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The impact of a participation requirement on the House, particularly its membership and functioning &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Options for the implementation of a retirement age and participation requirement, including without primary legislation, and transitional measures where appropriate.</li>\r\n</ul>",
